  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br><br>COMPLIMENTARY 6-SEATER LSV + 10 BIKES INCLUDED! <br><br>A STUNNING WaterColor vacation home awaits! Only minutes from Camp WaterColor and steps from WaterColor's generous trail system + the WaterColor Boathouse!<br><br>The spacious house boasts an incredible brand new kitchen, a carriage house with full kitchen (5 king beds total), and wonderful outdoor spaces including an outdoor dining space, outdoor fireplace + kitchen w string lights, and front porch with seating perfect for a cocktail!<br><br>The space<br><br>Welcome to Wiregrass Livin'!<br><br>This house truly has everything anyone could want in a vacation home - from the complimentary 6-seater LSV to the 10 complimentary bikes to the multiple peaceful porches for relaxing after a day at the beach to the gourmet chef's kitchen plus the expansive living spaces, it is an absolutely beautiful and comfortable home for a large family or groups!<br><br>From the top-of-the-line appliances to the gorgeous custom designer coastal decor and serene outdoor spaces perfect for entertaining, dining and relaxing - plus complimentary board games for the family's enjoyment - this fully-equipped home is the perfect spot for memories to be made! There are also complimentary beach chairs and umbrellas for guests' use.<br><br>This GORGEOUS home is situated in the ultra-desirable Lake District of the WaterColor community, making for easy + quick access to WaterColor's numerous amenity offerings (Camp WaterColor for families, the WaterColor Beach Club, Boathouse, etc. just to name a few)! It is just one block to the Frog Pond Pool and Sandhill Park (see photo for reference).<br><br>There is over 3,700 square feet of living space in this large corner-lot home, making for plenty of room to spread out comfortably. The home boasts marble counter tops throughout, stainless steel appliances, a massive breakfast bar with seating and eat-in kitchen, a spacious dining area, and a living room with doors that open to the outside, an outdoor fireplace and outdoor kitchen, a separate carriage house with full kitchen, multiple living and dining spaces, 5 king beds, and more!<br><br>HOME AMENITIES:<br>-Prime WaterColor location steps to pool<br>-6-Seater LSV included<br>-10 complimentary bikes<br>-3 minutes to Camp WaterColor, close to the beach, Boathouse, Seaside access and the WaterColor Beach Club <br>-Multiple expansive covered porches<br>-Built-in outdoor kitchen with barbeque grill, Big Green Egg and sink<br>-Outdoor fireplace with Adirondack chairs<br>-Designated outdoor dining table<br>-Front porch with comfortable seating perfect for sipping your morning coffee or an evening glass of wine<br>-Outdoor shower<br>-Fully equipped high-end chef's kitchen with top of the line appliances, and eat-in breakfast bar on the massive island<br>-Separate carriage house with its own full kitchen, bedroom, bathroom and living space with sleeper sofa<br>-There is parking for 3 cars in the driveway, or pads located throughout the community<br><br>This house comes with a maximum of 14 wristbands, which per the WaterColor HOA limits the number we accommodate even if there are sleeping arrangements in the home for more. Children under 5 are not required to wear a wristband so are not included in this number.<br><br>BEDROOM / BATHROOM ACCOMMODATIONS:<br><br>FIRST FLOOR<br>-Master King bedroom + en-suite bathroom with oversized glass shower and soaking tub (2)<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>-2nd master King bedroom+ en-suite bathroom with glass shower and soaking tub + private access to porch with large day bed porch swing (2)<br>-3rd King bedroom + en-suite bathroom with shower/tub combination (2)<br>-4th King bedroom + access to bathroom shared with bunk room with oversized glass shower (2)<br>-Bunk room with two sets of Full-over-Full bunks, each with their own TV (8)<br>-Half Bathroom<br><br>CARRIAGE HOUSE<br>-5th King bedroom + Full bathroom (2)<br>-Full kitchen and Living Room with Twin sleeper sofa (1)<br><br>There is also a pack n' play provided for guests' use!<br><br>Guest access<br><br>Guests will have inclusive access to the new Camp WaterColor facilities! It takes about 3 minutes to get there from the house - the ultra desirable and stunning Lake District location of this home is amazing! The entire Camp WaterColor establishment is geared towards kids and has: main butterfly pool with monarch slide for older kids, caterpillar pool (zero-entry + children's area with skipper slide for littler kids), lazy lizard pool (zero-entry + lazy river), lifeguards on duty, The Canteen restaurant + bar, basketball court, playing field, and playground.<br><br>Additionally, guests will have access to the newly expanded + renovated WaterColor Beach Club. It features a huge main pool and lounge area, additional pool deck with even more lounge seating, and third pool area with zero-entry (perfect for even the littlest kids!). It also has dining service available, and a sunset bar, Costa Chica. All of these amenities have beautiful views of the Gulf!<br><br>Other things to note<br>-Beach chairs through WaterColor Beach Club should be reserved well in advance.<br>-In order to receive the proper number of amenity wristbands, you must enter the total number of people in your travel group upon booking. Please bear in mind that the HOA will not be able to provide additional wristbands once you are here. Finally, the WaterColor HOA will charge $50 per wristband to replace any that are lost. <br>-Please note we provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher + laundry pods for your stay<br>-Weddings and other similar events not allowed at this home. Violation of any home rules may result in forfeiture of rental payments and deposits, as well as subject to HOA, community and management fines.<br>-Check in is 4:00 PM & check out is 10:00 AM. These times are strict and late check out may be subject to another day's rental fees.<br>-Smoking is strictly prohibited.<br>-All renters must be over 25 years of age, or if under age 25 must be accompanied by a parent/legal guardian.<br>-The LSV is not to be driven past the town of Seagrove to the East or the town of Grayton Beach to the West. Resolving any issue from the LSV battery dying because of the renters not charging it will be charged to the renters.<br>-Travel protection/insurance is not included. You are welcome to obtain this on your own.<br>-Damage that occurs will be collected from the renters.<br>-Southern Holiday Homes can not be held liable for any damage or injury to any persons caused by LSV, bikes or other amenities provided to guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "GORGEOUS WaterColor Beach Home w/ Carriage House, LSV, 10 Bikes!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
